      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:24.623375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For production use, `libxdp` (part of xdp-tools) and `libbpf` provide abstractions that handle the ring management, UMEM setup, and XDP program loading:",
